OL,3,AHead teacher evacuates 900 children
OL,4,Aminutes before school washed away by
OL,5,ANepal floods
OL,6,
OL,7,FA head teacher's quick decision to
OL,8,Fevacuate his school saved 900 pupils
OL,9,Ffrom deadly flash floods along the
OL,10,FNepal-Tibet border
OL,12,FRajendra Dawadi tells the BBC he was
OL,13,Ftipped off about the disaster and moved
OL,14,Fstudents to higher ground with just
OL,15,Fminutes to spare
OL,17,FOne pupil says she and her friends
OL,18,Fsurvived "by just 10 seconds" and
OL,19,Fwatched as a nearby bazaar was swept
OL,20,Faway
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
